TESTCASE SAMPLE.LOG_1
* In a unit test build, a DEFC function answers from the stubs.
    UTF.setTarget("SAMPLE.LOG")
    STUB = UTF.addStub("SampleLog")
    UTF.addStubParam(STUB, "hello", UTF.same())
    UTF.addStubParam(STUB, 3, UTF.same())
    UTF.setStubReturnValue(STUB, 7)
    UTF.addParam("hello")
    UTF.addParam(RESULT)
    UTF.runTest()
    UTF.assertEquals(RESULT, 7)
    UTF.assertEquals(UTF.getNbInvocation(STUB), 1)
END
